  "comment": "Tesseract OCR Tesseract OCR is a free and open source OCR software available for Linux. Sponsored by Google, and maintained by many volunteers, it is probably the most comprehensive OCR suite available out there that can even beat some paid, proprietary solutions. It provides command line tools as well as an API that you can integrate in your own programs. It can detect text in many languages",
